				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "adobYpJm2E9+IEOVqcx6IQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Framework ownership\nThis index records framework/package identities and platform scope for developers and agents. Start with {{gtPage:Catalyst working rules|db=731asfxqhyhdr96k6wo9yxnzv}}. Read the framework contract and inspect loaded source and existing checks before changing behavior. These names identify ownership in the running system; they are not filesystem destinations. Use this DevKit's GT Git or Iceberg project objects for an explicitly requested source publication step."
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-10-17T03:55:32.499Z"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-10-17T03:55:32.499Z"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "FiKqGd2oDt6LYc8qICn/VQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "| Framework | Source owner | Platform and current status |\n|---|---|---|\n| Runtime | CatalystRuntime, BVC-Runtime-* packages | GemStone 4.x reference; GT/Pharo release work now. {{gtPage:Catalyst Runtime|db=760mc3rkot5pkhueq2jxjz5gt}} |\n| Foundation models, configuration and Magritte | CatalystFoundation | Shared model/configuration responsibilities have portable boundaries; concrete GT presentation is GT-only. Existing architecture/extension documents remain pending their book replacement. |\n| Atelier and composition | CatalystFoundation | GT editing and presentation; Process owns BPMN-specific semantics. |\n| Motion and Physics | CatalystFoundation, BVC-Motion-* and BVC-Physics-* | Active GT/Pharo UI frameworks. CatalystMotion and CatalystPhysics repos are future extraction destinations. |\n| Process | CatalystProcess | BPMN semantics and execution-environment contracts; Runtime owns execution infrastructure. Older design/runtime paths remain pending a separate review. |\n| Theme | CatalystTheme | GT/Pharo appearance roles and presentation integration. |\n| DevKit and Barry | CatalystDevKit | GT development integration, common guidance and this ownership index. No separate Runtime engine. |\n| Connect | CatalystConnect reference; CatalystConnectCPP and CatalystConnectSwift implementations; CatalystConnectPlugin Unreal adapter | GemStone and GT/Pharo reference over Runtime; canonical protocol/conformance backlog in CatalystConnect. Implementation is pending. |\n| Connect protocol and compatibility | CatalystConnect/protocol and conformance; old DevKit BV-Catalyst-Connect-Core is a Store compatibility dependency | No ZeroMQ or QUIC in active Connect. Preserve old DevKit compatibility until Store is migrated; it is not the CATP reference. |\n| Users, Ground, Currency and other infant components | Current experiments; final component ownership remains to be established | Deferred Runtime consumers. Preserve intent and useful source; do not expand them while Runtime matures. |\n| Web | CatalystWeb | Early implementation; supported direction remains to be established. |"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-10-17T03:55:32.499Z"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-10-17T03:55:32.499Z"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "GEmOO276fE8RJjbhrd7CUQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Using the index\nA task should carry the owning framework/package identity, relevant contract references, the complete bounded change and its acceptance checks. Source edits are made in the image; publication through GT Git or Iceberg is a separate user-authorized step. Explorer investigates existing paths; Maintainer changes loaded code in the identified framework; Barry reviews the result against the contract and checks. The obsolete BV-Catalyst-Runtime-* packages in DevKit are retired; use CatalystRuntime for Runtime engine source. Other experiments and component pages are retained pending their separate replacement and must not be used as evidence of completed capabilities.\n\nConnect's prototype starts processing from socket events driving a SharedQueue. Its contract must identify connection/queue ownership, event ordering, backpressure, transaction boundaries and the handoff into Runtime. A generic second dispatcher is not required merely for platform symmetry."
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
